{
  "title": "Warm Silky Middle Eastern Eggplant Baba Ganoush",
  "description": "A tangy and silky Middle Eastern dish featuring roasted eggplant, cranberry juice, and a pasta water emulsion, perfect for a nostalgic and high protein friendly snack.",
  "cuisine": "Middle Eastern",
