  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Score the eggplant and roast it in the oven for 45 minutes, or until it is tender and collapsed.",
    "Remove the eggplant from the oven and let it cool down.",
    "Scoop the flesh of the eggplant into a blender or food processor.",
    "Add the cranberry juice, pasta water, tahini, garlic, lemon juice, olive oil, salt, and black pepper to the blender or food processor.",
    "Blend the mixture until it is smooth and silky.",
    "Taste the mixture and adjust the seasoning if necessary.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a serving bowl and serve it warm."
  ],
